{"seq":3,"slug":"ambiguity-uncertainty","title":"模糊与奈特不确定性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/decision-theory-philosophy/debates/ambiguity-uncertainty","wordCount":1588,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"模糊与奈特不确定性\">模糊与奈特不确定性</h1><p>期望效用理论有一个常被默认、却极苛刻的前提：每个状态都配有一个精确的概率。掷硬币能满足它，赌轮盘能满足它。可当问题变成「这家从没上市过同类产品的公司，明年成功的概率是多少」，或「一种全新病原体的致死率是多少」，这个前提就悬空了——不是概率是某个我们暂时不知道的确定数，而是<strong>根本没有</strong>一个有依据的精确概率可填。经济学家 Frank Knight 在 1921 年就把这种处境与「风险」区分开：可量化的叫风险，不可量化的叫<strong>不确定性</strong>。这一区分,直到今天仍在挑战决策论的地基。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>区分三层递进的认知状态。<strong>风险</strong>（risk）：状态的概率已知且精确。<strong>模糊</strong>（ambiguity）：状态已知，但其概率无法确定，只能给出一个概率区间或一族概率分布。<strong>奈特不确定性</strong>（Knightian uncertainty）：概率在原则上就无从量化。标准期望效用只在第一层可用；后两层需要放松「唯一精确概率」的假设，用一<strong>族</strong>概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{P}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0822em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 取代单一分布 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>，并对如何在这族分布上聚合给出新规则。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[对状态的了解程度] --&gt; B[风险: 概率精确已知]&#10;  A --&gt; C[模糊: 只知概率区间或一族分布]&#10;  A --&gt; D[奈特不确定: 概率原则上无法量化]&#10;  B --&gt; E[标准期望效用 EU]&#10;  C --&gt; F[用一族概率 P]&#10;  D --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[Maxmin EU: 对最坏分布取期望再最大化]&#10;  F --&gt; H[Choquet EU: 用非可加容度积分]&#10;  F --&gt; I[alpha-Maxmin: 最坏与最好加权]\">flowchart TD\n  A[对状态的了解程度] --&gt; B[风险: 概率精确已知]\n  A --&gt; C[模糊: 只知概率区间或一族分布]\n  A --&gt; D[奈特不确定: 概率原则上无法量化]\n  B --&gt; E[标准期望效用 EU]\n  C --&gt; F[用一族概率 P]\n  D --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[Maxmin EU: 对最坏分布取期望再最大化]\n  F --&gt; H[Choquet EU: 用非可加容度积分]\n  F --&gt; I[alpha-Maxmin: 最坏与最好加权]</pre><p>下表把三种不确定层次与其适用模型对照：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>概率信息</th>\n<th>代表模型</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>风险</td>\n<td>单一精确分布</td>\n<td>期望效用 EU</td>\n<td>赌场、精算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模糊</td>\n<td>一族分布 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{P}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0822em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>Maxmin EU、Choquet EU</td>\n<td>新产品、罕见事件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>奈特不确定</td>\n<td>无可靠概率</td>\n<td>稳健决策、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>-Maxmin</td>\n<td>深度不确定的政策</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"从-ellsberg-的直觉说起\">从 Ellsberg 的直觉说起</h2><p>人对模糊的敏感不是哲学臆测，而是可复现的行为。<a href=\"../practice/paradoxes\">Ellsberg 悖论</a>给出最干净的证据：一个装 30 个红球、以及 60 个「黄或黑、比例未知」球的罐子，多数人宁赌「抽到红」（概率明确为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/3</span></span></span></span></span>）也不赌「抽到黑」（概率在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2/3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2/3</span></span></span></span></span> 之间模糊），即便随后又宁赌「黑或黄」也不赌「红或黄」——两组选择合起来无法用任何单一概率分布解释。人在系统性地<strong>回避模糊</strong>：宁要说得清的赔率，也不要说不清的。</p>\n<p>这就是模型要捕捉的核心现象——<strong>模糊厌恶</strong>（ambiguity aversion）。它不同于风险厌恶：风险厌恶是对已知概率下的波动的厌恶，可由效用凹性表达；模糊厌恶是对「概率本身说不清」的额外厌恶，标准期望效用无论 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span> 取什么形状都无法容纳它。Ellsberg 的完整实验与它对萨维奇公理的冲击留给悖论篇；这里关心的是：既然人这样选，规范理论能否为这种选择提供合理的形式？</p>\n<h2 id=\"maxmin-期望效用与-choquet-积分\">Maxmin 期望效用与 Choquet 积分</h2><p>Gilboa 与 Schmeidler 1989 年的<strong>最大最小期望效用</strong>（Maxmin EU）是最有影响的回答。它说：当你只掌握一族可能的概率分布 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{P}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0822em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 时，对每个行动，先在这族分布里找出让它期望效用<strong>最低</strong>的那个分布，再选「这个最坏期望效用最高」的行动：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">P</mi></mrow></munder><mtext> </mtext><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>s</mi></munder><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V(a)=\\min_{P\\in\\mathcal{P}}\\ \\sum_{s} P(s)\\,u(f(a,s))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathcal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0822em;\">P</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7717em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.9em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.25em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>它是把<a href=\"../foundations/decision-model\">决策模型</a>里的 maximin 谨慎精神，从「结果」层面提升到了「概率分布」层面——对世界会挑你的错这一悲观假设做最优应对。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{P}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0822em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 越大（你越无知），评价越保守，自然导出模糊厌恶。</p>\n<p>Schmeidler 另一条等价而优雅的路线用<strong>非可加概率</strong>（容度，capacity）：允许概率不满足可加性（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ν</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>ν</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\nu(A)+\\nu(A^c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 可以小于 1，那个「缺口」正编码了模糊），并用 <strong>Choquet 积分</strong>替代普通期望。当容度是凸的时，Choquet 期望效用与 Maxmin EU 恰好等价。这类模型统称秩依/非可加期望效用，是<a href=\"../practice/bounded-rationality\">前景理论</a>概率权重函数的近亲。</p>\n<h2 id=\"在纯悲观与纯乐观之间-alpha-maxmin-与稳健决策\">在纯悲观与纯乐观之间：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>-Maxmin 与稳健决策</h2><p>纯 Maxmin 只盯最坏分布，未免过于悲观——它会让人为极小概率的灾难放弃大量期望收益。Hurwicz 式的推广 <strong><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>-Maxmin EU</strong> 用一个模糊态度系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha\\in[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 在最坏与最好之间加权：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">P</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>P</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">P</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>P</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V(a)=\\alpha\\min_{P\\in\\mathcal{P}}E_P[u]+(1-\\alpha)\\max_{P\\in\\mathcal{P}}E_P[u]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.5217em;vertical-align:-0.7717em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathcal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0822em;\">P</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7717em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.5217em;vertical-align:-0.7717em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathcal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0822em;\">P</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7717em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 退回纯悲观的 Maxmin，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 是纯乐观，中间值刻画不同的模糊态度。另一族思路是 Klibanoff–Marinacci–Mukerji 的<strong>平滑模糊模型</strong>，它在「对每个分布算期望效用」之外再套一层刻画模糊态度的函数，把风险态度与模糊态度干净地分离，便于计量。</p>\n<p>这些模型在现实里正被认真使用：气候政策、金融风险、公共卫生应对「深度不确定性」时，越来越多采用<strong>稳健决策</strong>（robust decision making）——不追求在某个单一预测下最优，而追求在一整族合理情景下都不至于灾难性地差。这与工程和机器学习里的分布鲁棒优化同源。它诚实地承认「我们不知道真实概率」，把决策的目标从「最大化期望」改为「在无知中活下来」，这一取向的实践落点见<a href=\"../practice/decision-theory-in-practice\">应用与边界</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Knight 区分可量化的「风险」与不可量化的「不确定性」；模糊介于其间，指概率只能给区间或一族分布。</li>\n<li>标准期望效用要求唯一精确概率，无法容纳「模糊厌恶」——Ellsberg 悖论稳健地证明人系统性回避说不清的赔率。</li>\n<li>Maxmin EU（Gilboa–Schmeidler）对一族分布里最坏的取期望再最大化；Choquet 期望效用用非可加容度，凸容度下二者等价。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>-Maxmin 与平滑模糊模型在悲观与乐观间调节；稳健决策把目标从「最大化期望」改为「在深度不确定中不至灾难」。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub：<a href=\"../practice/paradoxes\">悖论</a> 详解 Ellsberg 实验及其对公理的冲击；<a href=\"../foundations/decision-model\">决策模型</a> 的 maximin 是本篇 Maxmin EU 的原型；<a href=\"../practice/bounded-rationality\">有限理性</a> 的概率权重与非可加概率同源。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../../mathematics-statistics/probability-statistics/probability-foundations/bayes-theorem\">贝叶斯定理</a> 代表「坚持单一主观概率」的对立立场；<a href=\"../../../mathematics-statistics/game-theory/normal-form-and-nash/nash-equilibrium\">纳什均衡</a> 在对手策略不确定时也面对类似的一族信念问题。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"模糊与奈特不确定性","id":"模糊与奈特不确定性"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"从 Ellsberg 的直觉说起","id":"从-ellsberg-的直觉说起"},{"level":2,"text":"Maxmin 期望效用与 Choquet 积分","id":"maxmin-期望效用与-choquet-积分"},{"level":2,"text":"在纯悲观与纯乐观之间：\\alpha-Maxmin 与稳健决策","id":"在纯悲观与纯乐观之间-alpha-maxmin-与稳健决策"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"Newcomb 问题","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/decision-theory-philosophy/debates/newcomb-problem"},"next":{"title":"悖论：Allais 与 Ellsberg","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/decision-theory-philosophy/practice/paradoxes"}}